---
import { AGENDA } from "../../lib/contact";
import StudioLayout from "../../layouts/StudioLayout.astro";
import CartesCas from "../../components/studio/CartesCas.astro";
---
<StudioLayout
  titre='Automate what really costs you'
  description='Kigumi identifies the processes that weigh most on your company, deploys the AI agents that handle them, and measures the real gain.'
  actif="">
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Process automation &middot; Small &amp; mid-sized companies</span>
    <h1>Automate what<br>really costs you.<br><span class="accent">And prove it.</span></h1>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <p class="lead">Kigumi identifies the processes that weigh most on your company, deploys the AI agents that handle them, and measures the real gain.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn" href={AGENDA} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a 45-minute pre-diagnosis</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/en/method/">See the method</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">What we take over</p>
    <h2>Three examples, among many others</h2>
    <p class="lead">We have studied many processes in detail. They share a high volume of repetitive tasks that follow known rules. Automating them can free up time to handle complex requests, support your customers or respond to more tenders.</p>
    <div style="margin-top:34px"><CartesCas /></div>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top:24px;font-size:14px">Illustrative examples, built from situations observed in these industries. No missions delivered to date.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:14px"><a href="/en/use-cases/">See every case, by process and by role &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tint">
  <div class="wrap">
   <div class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Who does the work</p>
    <h2>Nearly thirty years in the trade, between two people</h2>
    <p>Julien has worked with customers for nearly fifteen years, from selling IT solutions to large organisations to leading a team of eleven in customer relations, support and project management.</p>
    <p>St&eacute;phane has spent nearly fifteen years building software products used by millions of people. He has led development, R&amp;D and machine learning teams.</p>
    <p>We bring together support for your teams and technical delivery to automate your processes. <strong>The two partners who sell you the mission are the ones who deliver it</strong>, with no subcontracting.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:1.4em"><a href="/en/about/">Who we are &rarr;</a></p>
   </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">How we work</p>
    <h2>A method in four stages</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><div class="n">1</div><div><h3>Diagnosis</h3><p class="muted">With your teams, we identify your processes and understand how they work. We estimate their costs and potential gains, then select those worth automating. You keep the report, even if you stop there.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="n">2</div><div><h3>Foundation</h3><p class="muted">We gather the information and rules the agents will need, only for the processes selected.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="n">3</div><div><h3>Deployment</h3><p class="muted">We build the AI agents, connect them to your tools and put them into service with your teams. Steps that commit your company remain subject to human approval.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="n">4</div><div><h3>Oversight and verification</h3><p class="muted">We monitor the agents and fix malfunctions. Every quarter, a report compares the real gain with the diagnosis projection, including when the gap isn&rsquo;t in our favour.</p></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/en/method/">The method in detail</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>45 minutes to find out whether it&rsquo;s worth it</h2>
    <p>We look at your processes together, and you&rsquo;ll know whether there is enough for a diagnosis. If nothing at your company is worth automating, we&rsquo;ll tell you.</p>
    <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href={AGENDA} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a call</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
</StudioLayout>
